  "title": "Esquites",
  "description": "Esquites are similar to Mexican elote, but the kernels are removed from the cob. Combined with cotija, crema, lime juice, and cilantro, it tastes sweet, smokey, salty, and spicy.",
  "authors": [
    "Brian Genest"
